msgid "Edit Mode Auto-Save"
msgstr "编辑模式自动保存"

msgid ""
"Automatically save a backup every few minutes while in Edit Mode. Blender's Auto-Save does not work in Edit Mode, so this feature is needed to recover long modeling sessions.\n"
"\n"
"Disable if you have another auto save add-on enabled or if you notice a significant slow down and do not want to auto save while working in Edit Mode."
msgstr ""
"在编辑模式下每隔几分钟自动保存备份。Blender 的自动保存功能在编辑模式下不起作用，因此需要此功能来恢复长时间建模会话。\n"
"\n"
"如果启用了其他自动保存插件，或者发现速度明显变慢且不希望在工作时自动保存，请禁用此功能."

msgid "Expand Masking Options"
msgstr "展开蒙版选项"

msgid "Show masking options for brush tools directly in the 3D View tool header rather than in a menu. Useful when working on larger screens."
msgstr "直接在 3D 视图工具栏中显示画笔工具的蒙版选项，而不是在菜单中。适用于在大屏幕上工作时使用."

msgid "Expand Mirror Axes"
msgstr "展开镜像轴"

msgid "Show the X, Y, and Z axis toggles next to the mirror menu"
msgstr "在镜像菜单旁边显示 X、Y 和 Z 轴切换按钮"

msgid "Expand Tools"
msgstr "展开工具"

msgid "Shows all tools in the toolbar, which takes up more space but makes them more accessible"
msgstr "在工具栏中显示所有工具，虽然占用更多空间，但使它们更易访问"

msgid "Expand Overlay Offset"
msgstr "展开覆盖偏移"

msgid "Displays the retopology overlay offset in the tool header"
msgstr "在工具栏中显示拓扑覆盖偏移"

msgid "Highlight Color"
msgstr "高亮颜色"

msgid "The color used by the insert tools when adding new geometry"
msgstr "插入工具添加新几何体时使用的颜色"

msgid "Vertex Size"
msgstr "顶点大小"

msgid "The visual size of each vertex in the viewport. This is only used when Component Size is enabled under Tool Switching"
msgstr "视口中每个顶点的视觉大小。仅在工具切换下的组件大小启用时使用"

msgid "Edge Width"
msgstr "边宽"

msgid "The visual size of each edge in the viewport. This is only used when Component Size is enabled under Tool Switching"
msgstr "视口中每条边的视觉大小。仅在工具切换下的组件大小启用时使用"

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

msgid "The color of mesh compenents while using Retopoflow"
msgstr "使用 Retopoflow 时网格组件的颜色"

msgid "Blender"
msgstr "Blender"

msgid "The theme is not changed from your regular Blender preferences"
msgstr "主题不会从您的常规 Blender 偏好设置中更改"

msgid "Blue"
msgstr "蓝色"

msgid "Changes the color of components while using Retopoflow"
msgstr "在 Retopoflow 使用时更改组件颜色"

msgid "Green"
msgstr "绿色"

msgid "Orange"
msgstr "橙色"

msgid "Pink"
msgstr "粉色"

msgid "Purple"
msgstr "紫色"

msgid "Pie Tool Context"
msgstr "派生工具上下文"

msgid "The context in which the pie hotmenu will be shown"
msgstr "派生热菜单将在此上下文中显示"

msgid "Any Tool"
msgstr "任意工具"

msgid "Can trigger the pie hotmenu from ANY tool"
msgstr "可以触发任何工具的饼图热菜单"

msgid "Retopoflow Tools"
msgstr "Retopoflow 工具"

msgid "Can trigger the pie hotmenu ONLY on Retopoflow tools"
msgstr "仅可在 RetopoFlow 工具上触发饼图热菜单。"

msgid "Auto Merge"
msgstr "自动合并"

msgid "Automatically enables Auto Merge when using Retopoflow tools"
msgstr "使用 Retopoflow 工具时自动启用自动合并"

msgid "Fade Inactive"
msgstr "淡出未激活"

msgid "Automatically enables Fade Inactive Geometry when using Retopoflow tools"
msgstr "使用 Retopoflow 工具时自动启用“淡出非活动几何体”"

msgid "Object Wires"
msgstr "对象线框"

msgid "Automatically enables wires for the active object when using Retopoflow tools, so you can see the result of modifiers"
msgstr "使用 Retopoflow 工具时，自动为当前对象启用线框模式，以便查看修改器的效果。"

msgid "Retopology Overlay"
msgstr "拓扑覆盖层"

msgid "Automatically enables the retopology overlay when using Retopoflow tools"
msgstr "使用 Retopoflow 工具时自动启用拓扑覆盖层"

msgid "Selection Mode"
msgstr "选择模式"

msgid "Automatically adjusts the selection mode for the selected Retopoflow tool"
msgstr "为选定的 Retopoflow 工具自动调整选择模式"

msgid "Snapping"
msgstr "吸附"

msgid "Automatically adjusts Blender's snapping settings for the selected Retopoflow tool"
msgstr "为选定的 Retopoflow 工具自动调整 Blender 的吸附设置"

msgid "Component Size"
msgstr "组件大小"

msgid "Use a separate size for vertices and edges when in Retopoflow tools"
msgstr "在 Retopoflow 工具中，为顶点和边使用独立的大小"

msgid "Selection Adjustments"
msgstr "选择调整"

msgid ""
"Alters the hotkeys for selection while Retopoflow is active. \n"
" - Loop selection gets stopped at inner corners for better use with Strokes. \n"
" - Pick Shortest Path with Shift has Fill Region disabled"
msgstr ""
"当 Retopoflow 激活时更改快捷键。\n"
" - 环选在内部拐角处停止，以便更好地配合笔刷使用。\n"
" - Shift+ 最短路径拾取禁用填充区域"

msgid "Pinning via Creases"
msgstr "通过折痕固定"

msgid ""
"Hijacks Blender's vertex crease system so we can display pins without any performance overhead. Disable this if you need to actively adjust creases while in Retopoflow mode. \n"
"\n"
"WARNING: Disabling will remove all current pins"
msgstr ""
"劫持 Blender 的顶点折痕系统，以便在不产生任何性能开销的情况下显示固定点。如果您需要在 Retopoflow 模式下主动调整折痕，请禁用此选项。\n"
"\n"
"警告：禁用将移除所有当前固定点"

msgid "Select Distance"
msgstr "选择距离"

msgid "Distance on screen to select geometry"
msgstr "在屏幕上用于选择几何体的距离"

msgid "Mouse Auto Select"
msgstr "鼠标自动选择"

msgid "Selects the geometry under the cursor, if any, before transforming using the mouse"
msgstr "在使用鼠标进行变换之前，选择光标下方的几何体（如果有的话）"

msgid "Keyboard Auto Select"
msgstr "键盘自动选择"

msgid "Selects the geometry under the cursor, if any, before transforming using keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "在使用键盘快捷键进行变换之前，选择光标下方的几何体（如果有的话）"

msgid "New Object Name"
msgstr "新对象名称"

msgid "The name of the new retopology object when creating one at the 3D Cursor"
msgstr "创建 3D 光标处的新拓扑对象名称"

msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜索"

msgid "The text to find and replace in the active object name. Not case sensative"
msgstr "在活动对象名称中查找和替换的文本。不区分大小写"

msgid "Replace"
msgstr "替换"

msgid "The text that replaces the searched for text when creating a new retopology object from the active object"
msgstr "从活动对象创建新拓扑对象时，用来替换所搜索文本的内容"

msgid "From Active Suffix"
msgstr "来自活动后缀"

msgid "When creating a new retopo object from the active object, the new object will inherit the active object name with this added at the end. Only used when the searched for text is not found"
msgstr "从活动对象创建新拓扑对象时，新对象将在末尾添加此后缀。仅在未找到搜索文本时使用"

msgid "No Sources Detected"
