msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Insert Diamond Junction (Retopoflow)"
msgstr "插入钻石关节（Retopoflow）"

msgid "Bevel each selected edge run into three loops. The loops are capped with diamond quads or run straight off the boundary."
msgstr "将每个选定的边缘运行转换为三个环。这些环用菱形四边形封闭，或沿边界直线延伸。"

msgid "Insert Diamond Junction"
msgstr "插入钻石连接点"

msgid "Factor"
msgstr "因子"

msgid "How far the new edge loops slide from the initial loop"
msgstr "新边缘环相对于初始环滑动的距离"

msgid "Merge Ends"
msgstr "合并端点"

msgid "Merge the diamond's outside vert into the end vert of the initial loop so the adjacent faces stay quads. When off, the diamond stops short of the end and leaves an n-gon on each side."
msgstr "将钻石的外侧顶点合并到初始环的末端顶点，使相邻面保持四边形。当关闭时，钻石会停在末端之前，并在每侧留下一个 N 边形。"

msgid "Flatten"
msgstr "展平"

msgid "On sharp surfaces, move middle loop verts along their normals to keep the new faces from bending across the original loop"
msgstr "在尖锐表面上，沿法线移动中间环的顶点，使新面不会跨越原始环弯曲"

msgid "Loops"
msgstr "环"

msgid "Level the middle loop with the two outer loops so the face runs between the caps are as flat as possible"
msgstr "将中间环与两个外环对齐，使面在帽之间尽可能平坦"

msgid "Caps"
msgstr "帽"

msgid "Flatten each diamond cap, then interpolate the rest of the middle loop between the cap heights"
msgstr "展平每个菱形帽，然后在中环和帽高度之间插值其余部分"

msgid "Leave the middle loop verts where they are"
msgstr "保持中间环顶点位置不变"

msgid "selection branches; select simple edge runs"
msgstr "选择分支；选择简单的边运行"

msgid "select one or more edge runs"
msgstr "选择一个或多个边运行"

msgid "Diamond Junction: {msg}"
msgstr "菱形连接：{msg}"

