msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove Object from Cache"
msgstr "从缓存中移除对象"

msgid "Remove this object's cached data (feature edges and/or Walk topology) so it is rescanned on the next rebuild.  All other cached objects are unaffected"
msgstr "移除此对象的缓存数据（特征边和/或 Walk 拓扑），以便在下一次重建时重新扫描。所有其他缓存对象不受影响"

msgid "Object Name"
msgstr "对象名称"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Relax (Retopoflow)"
msgstr "松弛 (Retopoflow)"

msgid "Relax the selected vertices using the Retopoflow relax algorithm"
msgstr "使用 Retopoflow 松弛算法对选定的顶点进行松弛处理"

msgid "Relax Selected Vertices"
msgstr "松弛选定顶点"

msgid "Iterations"
msgstr "迭代次数"

msgid "Number of times to run the relax simulation. Higher is smoother and slower"
msgstr "运行松弛模拟的次数。数值越高，结果越平滑但速度越慢"

msgid "How far vertices move per iteration"
msgstr "每次迭代中顶点移动的距离"

msgid "Smooth Vertices"
msgstr "平滑顶点"

msgid "Average vertex locations using Laplacian smoothing"
msgstr "使用拉普拉斯平滑平均顶点位置"

msgid "Straighten Edges"
msgstr "拉直边缘"

msgid "Move each vertex toward making its connected edges straighter, using loop information when possible"
msgstr "使用环信息尽可能使每个顶点连接的边更直"

msgid "Average Edge Lengths"
msgstr "平均边长"

msgid "Squash or stretch each edge toward the average edge length. Can cause skewing when used by itself"
msgstr "将每条边向平均边长挤压或拉伸。单独使用时可能导致扭曲"

msgid "Equalize Faces"
msgstr "均衡面"

msgid "Push faces towards ideal geometric shapes and average their sizes"
msgstr "将面推向理想的几何形状并使其大小均等"

msgid "Shaping"
msgstr "造型"

msgid "Post-processing applied after each relax step to control overall shape"
msgstr "在每个松弛步骤后应用的后期处理，用于控制整体形状"

msgid "No additional shaping"
msgstr "无额外造型"

msgid "Preserve Volume"
msgstr "保持体积"

msgid "Scales relaxed vertices so the mesh stays the same size"
msgstr "平滑松弛顶点，使网格保持相同大小"

msgid "Interpolate Loop Curvature"
msgstr "插值环曲率"

msgid "Uses the loop edges just outside the selection to create the loop's curvature. Can be used to reconstruct a quad patch on a sphere, for example"
msgstr "使用选择外部的环边缘来创建环的曲率。可用于在球面上重建四边形补丁等"

msgid "Slide Edges"
msgstr "滑动边"

msgid "Restrict vertex movement to be along their connected edges"
msgstr "限制顶点移动方向为沿其连接的边"

msgid "Proportional Editing"
msgstr "比例编辑"

msgid "Relax nearby connected vertices with a falloff for the strength"
msgstr "使附近的连接顶点以强度衰减的方式松弛"

msgid "Distance"
msgstr "距离"

msgid "Radius within which connected vertices are included"
msgstr "包含连接顶点的比例半径范围内的范围"

msgid "Shape of the strength curve from center to edge of the proportional radius"
msgstr "从中心到比例半径边缘的强度曲线形状"

msgid "Smooth"
msgstr "平滑"

msgid "Smooth falloff (3t² - 2t³)"
msgstr "平滑衰减（3t² - 2t³）"

msgid "Sphere"
msgstr "球体"

msgid "Spherical falloff (√(1 - t²))"
msgstr "球状衰减（√(1 - t²)）"

msgid "Root"
msgstr "根号"

msgid "Root falloff (√(1 - t))"
msgstr "根号衰减（√(1 - t)）"

msgid "Inverse Square"
msgstr "平方反比"

msgid "Inverse-square falloff (1/(1+t))"
msgstr "平方反比衰减（1/(1+t)）"

msgid "Sharp"
msgstr "锐利"

msgid "Sharp falloff (t²)"
msgstr "锐利衰减（t²）"

msgid "Linear"
msgstr "线性"

msgid "Linear falloff (1 - t)"
msgstr "线性衰减（1-t）"

msgid "Constant"
msgstr "常量"

msgid "No falloff — all verts get full strength"
msgstr "无衰减——所有顶点均获得完整强度"

msgid "Random"
msgstr "随机"

msgid "Random falloff"
msgstr "随机衰减"

msgid "Surface to project vertices onto after each relax step"
msgstr "每个松弛步骤后投影顶点到表面的表面"

msgid "Project each vertex back onto the original mesh shape before relaxation"
msgstr "在松弛之前，将每个顶点投影回原始网格形状上。"

msgid "Name of the object to snap vertices to"
msgstr "要吸附到对象的顶点名称"

msgid "Name of the collection to snap vertices to"
msgstr "要吸附到顶点的集合名称"

msgid "Snap to Source Sharps"
msgstr "吸附到源尖角"

msgid "Snap vertices to the sharp edges of the source mesh"
msgstr "将顶点吸附到源网格的尖角边缘"

msgid "Snap to Source Seams"
msgstr "吸附到源接缝"

msgid "Snap vertices to the seams of the source mesh"
msgstr "将顶点吸附到源网格的接缝处"

msgid "Snap to Source Creases"
msgstr "吸附到源折痕"

msgid "Snap vertices to the creases of the source mesh"
msgstr "将顶点吸附到源网格的折痕处"

msgid "Angle"
msgstr "角度"

msgid "Snap to edges above this angle threshold on the source object"
msgstr "仅吸附源对象上超过此角度阈值的边缘"

msgid "Use Angle Threshold"
msgstr "使用角度阈值"

msgid "Detect sharp edges on the source mesh based on face angle"
msgstr "基于面角检测源网格上的尖角边缘"

msgid "Proximity"
msgstr "距离"

msgid "How close to feature edges vertices must be to snap, as a fraction of the average edge length"
msgstr "顶点必须靠近特征边缘的距离，以平均边长的分数表示"

msgid "Fixed Distance"
msgstr "固定距离"

msgid "Snap within a fixed world space distance instead of scaling the snap distance by the local edge length"
msgstr "使用固定的世界空间距离而不是根据局部边长缩放吸附距离"

msgid "World space distance within which vertices snap to source feature edges and corners"
msgstr "顶点吸附到源特征边缘和角点的世界空间距离范围"

msgid "Stickiness"
msgstr "粘性"

msgid "How difficult it is for vertices to escape feature edges"
msgstr "顶点逃离特征边缘的难度"

msgid "Guide Loops"
msgstr "引导环"

msgid "How strongly elected loops are pulled toward the source edge"
msgstr "选定的环被拉向源边的强度"

msgid "Selected"
msgstr "选中"

msgid "Which vertices to relax based on selection state"
msgstr "基于选择状态的松弛顶点"

msgid "Relax all vertices regardless of selection"
msgstr "忽略选择状态，松弛所有顶点"

msgid "Only"
msgstr "仅"

msgid "Relax only selected vertices"
msgstr "仅松弛被选中的顶点"

msgid "Exclude"
msgstr "排除"

msgid "Relax only unselected vertices"
msgstr "仅松弛未被选中的顶点"

msgid "Boundary"
msgstr "边界"

msgid "How to handle boundary geometry"
msgstr "如何处理边界几何体"

msgid "Include"
msgstr "包含"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of being along boundary"
msgstr "无论是否位于边界，均松弛顶点"

msgid "Slide"
msgstr "滑动边线"

msgid "Relax vertices along boundary, sliding along boundary edges"
msgstr "沿边界松弛顶点，沿边界边缘滑动"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along boundary"
msgstr "不沿边界松弛顶点"

msgid "Seams"
msgstr "接缝"

msgid "How to handle seam edges"
msgstr "如何处理接缝边缘"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of being along a seam"
msgstr "无论是否位于接缝都松弛顶点"

msgid "Relax vertices along seams by sliding along them"
msgstr "沿接缝通过滑动方式松弛顶点"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along seams"
msgstr "不沿接缝松弛顶点"

msgid "Sharps"
msgstr "锐角边"

msgid "How to handle sharp edges"
msgstr "如何处理锐角边缘"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of being along a sharp edge"
msgstr "忽略是否位于锐利边缘的顶点松弛"

msgid "Relax vertices along sharp edges by sliding along them"
msgstr "沿锐利边缘滑动以松弛顶点"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along sharp edges"
msgstr "不沿锐利边缘松弛顶点"

msgid "Creases"
msgstr "折痕"

msgid "How to handle creased edges"
msgstr "如何处理折痕边缘"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of being along a crease"
msgstr "忽略是否位于折痕的顶点松弛"

msgid "Relax vertices along creases by sliding along them"
msgstr "沿折痕滑动以松弛顶点"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along creases"
msgstr "不沿折痕松弛顶点"

msgid "Sharp Angles"
msgstr "尖角"

msgid "How to handle vertices on edges whose adjacent faces exceed the angle threshold"
msgstr "处理相邻面超过角度阈值的边上的顶点"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of edge angle"
msgstr "忽略边角的顶点松弛"

msgid "Relax vertices along high-angle edges by sliding along them"
msgstr "沿高角度边滑动以松弛顶点"

msgid "Do not relax vertices that lie on edges exceeding the angle threshold"
msgstr "不松弛位于超过角度阈值的边上的顶点"

msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "阈值"

msgid "Edges whose adjacent face dihedral angle exceeds this value are treated as high-angle"
msgstr "相邻面二面角超过此值的边被视为高角度边"

msgid "Corners"
msgstr "角落"

msgid "Include corners (vertices with exactly two edges)"
msgstr "包含角落（拥有恰好两条边的顶点）"

msgid "Select"
msgstr "选择"

msgid "After relaxing, replace the selection with the chosen guide-loop vert set for debugging"
msgstr "松弛后，用选定的引导环顶点集替换选择以进行调试"

msgid "Leave selection unchanged after relaxing"
msgstr "松弛后保持选择不变"

msgid "Promoted"
msgstr "已提升"

msgid "Select only the elected guide-loop vertices"
msgstr "仅选中选定的引导环顶点"

msgid "Demoted"
