msgstr "将网格分割为由脊、凹槽和锐利边缘界定的区域"

msgid "Seed Threshold"
msgstr "种子阈值"

msgid "Areas below this multiple of the typical (median) seam energy become region seeds — lower gives more regions. 1.0 = the quiet-surface level of the mesh"
msgstr "低于此倍数（典型中值缝能量）的区域成为区域种子——更低的值会产生更多区域。1.0 = 网格的平静表面级别"

msgid "Seed Size Gate"
msgstr "种子大小门限"

msgid "Minimum seed area in feature-scale² units. Smaller quiet flecks are skipped at seeding but may still seed later if the rising waterline grows them while no region has reached them"
msgstr "特征尺度单位中的最小种子面积。较小的静斑在播种时被跳过，但如果上升的水线在其生长过程中没有区域到达它们，则仍可能随后播种"

msgid "Bridge Gaps"
msgstr "桥接缝隙"

msgid "Extract coherent seam lines and bridge gaps where they fade out, up to this many feature-scale units — keeps basins fenced at fading seam ends (banana-tip horseshoes). 0 disables"
msgstr "提取相干缝线并在其消失处桥接缝隙，最多为这么多特征尺度单位——保持盆地被封闭在消失的缝端（香蕉尖端马蹄形）。0 禁用"

msgid "Snap Boundaries"
msgstr "吸附边界"

msgid "Coarse-to-fine refinement: re-place each region boundary onto the sharpest nearby fine-scale feature line, searching within the detecting blur radius times this multiplier (the drift bound the energy itself implies). 0 disables"
msgstr "从粗到细的细化：将每个区域边界重新放置到附近最锐利的细尺度特征线上，搜索范围为该检测模糊半径乘以此倍率（能量本身所暗示的漂移界限）。0 禁用"

msgid "Merge Below"
msgstr "合并以下"

msgid "EXPERIMENTAL: dissolve region boundaries whose median seam energy is below this multiple of the typical surface energy. Soft true seams and fragment noise overlap in energy level, so any nonzero value trades real boundaries for cleanup — 0 (off) is the safe default until a coherence-based criterion lands"
msgstr "实验性：溶解其中位缝能量低于典型表面能量的若干倍的区域边界。软真缝和碎片噪声在能量水平上重叠，因此任何非零值都是在真实边界与清理之间进行权衡——0（关闭）是安全的默认设置，直到基于相干性的标准落地为止"

msgid "Feature Scale"
msgstr "特征尺度"

msgid "Physical size of the features to segment by, in object units. 0 = automatic (7x mean edge length)"
msgstr "按其特征分割的物理尺寸，以对象单位表示。0 = 自动（7×平均边缘长度）"

