msgstr "允许被钉住的顶点受到影响"

msgid "Display"
msgstr "显示"

msgid "How the mirrored geometry is previewed"
msgstr "镜像几何体的预览方式"

msgid "The mirrored geometry is not previewed"
msgstr "不预览镜像几何体"

msgid "Applied"
msgstr "已应用"

msgid "The mirrored geometry is displayed as applied to the vertices"
msgstr "镜像几何体已应用于顶点显示"

msgid "Wire"
msgstr "线框"

msgid "The mirrored geometry is overlaid as a wireframe"
msgstr "镜像几何体以线框形式叠加显示"

msgid "Solid"
msgstr "实体"

msgid "The mirrored geometry is overlaid as a solid object"
msgstr "镜像几何体被叠加为实体对象"

msgid "Displace"
msgstr "置换"

msgid "Displaces non-boundary vertices as a factor of the retopology overlay distance for better visibility. If the effect is too extreme, you likely need to reduce the retopology overlay distance instead."
msgstr "将非边界顶点沿拓扑覆盖距离的比例进行位移，以获得更好的可见性。如果效果过于极端，您可能需要减小拓扑覆盖距离。"

msgid "Displace Boundaries"
msgstr "位移边界"

msgid "Include mesh boundaries in the displacement"
msgstr "在置换中包含网格边界"

msgid "Displace Connected"
msgstr "位移连接"

msgid "Include vertices connected to the original mesh (usually along the center line) in the displacement"
msgstr "包含与原始网格连接的顶点（通常沿中心线）进行位移"

msgid "Wireframe"
msgstr "线框图"

msgid "Displays the wireframe on top of the mirrored geometry"
msgstr "在镜像几何体上方显示线框图"

msgid "Wire Thickness"
msgstr "线框厚度"

msgid "Size of the wireframe display in world space"
msgstr "世界空间中线框图的尺寸"

msgid "Controls how solid or transparent the mirror preview is"
msgstr "控制镜像预览的实心或透明程度"

msgid "Occluded"
msgstr "遮挡"

msgid "Include vertices that are hidden behind other geometry"
msgstr "包含被其他几何体遮挡的顶点"

msgid "Include vertices that have been pinned by Retopoflow"
msgstr "包含被 Retopoflow 固定的顶点"

msgid "All Islands"
msgstr "所有岛屿"

msgid "Transform every mesh island under the brush. When off, only the island nearest the brush center is affected"
msgstr "转换画笔下的每个网格岛。当关闭时，仅影响离画笔中心最近的岛屿"

msgid "Mask Boundary"
msgstr "边界遮罩"

msgid "Relax vertices along boundary, but move them by sliding along boundary"
msgstr "沿边界松弛顶点，但通过沿边界滑动移动它们"

msgid "Mask Symmetry"
msgstr "对称性遮罩"

msgid "How to handle geometry near symmetry plane"
msgstr "如何处理靠近对称平面的几何体"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of being along symmetry plane"
msgstr "无论是否位于对称平面都松弛顶点"

msgid "Relax vertices along symmetry plane, but move them by sliding along symmetry plane"
msgstr "沿对称面松弛顶点，但通过沿对称面滑动移动它们"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along symmetry plane"
msgstr "不沿对称面松弛顶点"

msgid "Mask Selected"
msgstr "选中遮罩"

msgid "How to handle selected geometry"
msgstr "如何处理选定的几何体"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of selection"
msgstr "忽略选择，放松顶点"

msgid "Mask Creases"
msgstr "遮罩折痕"

msgid "Relax vertices along a crease, but move them by sliding along the crease"
msgstr "沿折痕放松顶点，但通过沿折痕滑动来移动它们"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along a crease"
msgstr "不沿折痕放松顶点"

msgid "Mask Sharps"
msgstr "遮罩锐边"

msgid "How to handle edges marked as sharp"
msgstr "如何处理标记为锐边的边缘"

msgid "Relax vertices along a sharp edge, but move them by sliding along it"
msgstr "沿锐边放松顶点，但通过沿其滑动来移动它们"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along a sharp edge"
msgstr "不沿锐边放松顶点"

msgid "Mask Seams"
msgstr "遮罩接缝"

msgid "How to handle seams"
msgstr "如何处理接缝"

msgid "Relax vertices regardless of being along a seams"
msgstr "无论是否沿接缝，都放松顶点"

msgid "Relax vertices along a seams, but move them by sliding along it"
msgstr "仅沿接缝放松顶点，但使其沿接缝滑动移动"

msgid "Do not relax vertices along a seams"
msgstr "不沿接缝放松顶点"

msgid "Mask Angle"
msgstr "角度遮罩"

msgid "Angle Threshold"
msgstr "角度阈值"

msgid "Exclude Non-selected"
msgstr "排除未选中项"

msgid "Only selected objects in Object Mode are considered as valid sources. This allows you to manage what you snap to in the Outliner"
msgstr "在对象模式下，只有选中的对象被视为有效源。这允许您在大纲视图中管理要吸附的对象"

msgid "Source Object"
msgstr "源对象"

msgid "Source Collection"
msgstr "源集合"

msgid "Automatically rebuild the source feature cache when entering RetopoFlow, when detection settings change, or when a source mesh is edited. Turn off to keep the cache frozen and rebuild only with the Rebuild Source Cache button"
msgstr "进入 RetopoFlow 时、检测设置更改时或源网格被编辑时自动重建源特征缓存。关闭此选项可保持缓存冻结，仅通过“重建源缓存”按钮进行重建"

msgid "Batch Size (12^n)"
msgstr "批量大小 (12^n)"

msgid "Chunk size exponent for incremental source-cache rebuilding. Actual chunk size is 12^n for both edge and vertex chunks. Higher n rebuilds faster but can reduce UI responsiveness"
msgstr "增量源缓存重建的块大小指数。实际块大小为 12^n（适用于边和顶点块）。更高的 n 值会更快重建但可能降低 UI 响应速度"

msgid "Snap vertices to the creases of the high poly mesh"
msgstr "将顶点吸附到高多边形网格的边缘处"

msgid "Snap vertices to the seams of the high poly mesh"
msgstr "将顶点吸附到高多边形网格的接缝处"

msgid "Snap vertices to the sharps of the high poly mesh"
msgstr "将顶点吸附到高多边形网格的锐角处"

msgid "How difficult it is to drag a snapped vertex back off of a feature edge or corner"
msgstr "拖拽已吸附的顶点离开特征边或角的难度"

msgid "How strongly the nearest retopo loop is attracted to the source edge while competing loops are kept away"
msgstr "在竞争循环被推开的同时，最近的重拓扑环被吸引到源边的程度"

msgid "How vertices are projected onto the source mesh during tweaking"
msgstr "调整期间顶点如何投影到源网格上"

msgid "Automatically choose screen space or world space projection based on the selection"
msgstr "根据选择自动选择屏幕空间或世界空间投影"

msgid "Always project using Face Project (screen space)"
msgstr "始终使用面投影（屏幕空间）"

msgid "Always project using Face Nearest (world space)"
msgstr "始终使用最近面投影（世界空间）"

msgid "Follow Blender"
msgstr "跟随 Blender"

msgid "Use Blender's current snap_elements_individual setting without overriding it"
msgstr "在不覆盖的情况下使用 Blender 当前的 snap_elements_individual 设置"

msgid "Correct Face Normals"
msgstr "修正法线"

msgid "Point newly created and transformed faces outwards, matching the nearest surface on the source mesh where there is one and the surrounding faces where there is not"
msgstr "将新创建和变换的面指向外部，在有源网格最近表面的地方与周围表面匹配，在没有的地方则指向周围面"

