msgstr "新切割中创建的顶点数量"

msgid "Loop Count"
msgstr "环数"

msgid "Number of loops to create when extruding"
msgstr "挤出时创建的环的数量"

msgid "Process Source Method"
msgstr "处理源方法"

msgid "Source processing method"
msgstr "源处理方法"

msgid "Walk"
msgstr "行走"

msgid ""
"Walks every face along the source mesh. \n"
"Slow on high res models but very accurate. \n"
"Only supports manifold geometry."
msgstr ""
"沿源网格遍历每个面。  \n"
"高分辨率模型上速度较慢，但非常精确。  \n"
"仅支持流形几何体。"

msgid "SDF"
msgstr "SDF"

msgid ""
"Builds a distance testing grid around the source mesh and iteratively refines it. \n"
"This method can process extremely high poly sources fairly quickly and can handle flipped normals, split edges, and overhangs. Does not work on thin surfaces."
msgstr "围绕源网格构建距离测试网格，并迭代优化。此方法可以快速处理极多面数的源对象，能够处理法线翻转、分割边和悬垂结构。不适用于薄表面。"

msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快速"

msgid ""
"Raycasts into the mesh to find its volume center, raycasts in a circle to find the surface, then refines that result with... more raycasts. \n"
"Very fast but less accurate, especially with smaller extrusions and overhangs. Does not work on thin surfaces."
msgstr "向网格发射射线以找到其体积中心，在圆周上发射射线以找到表面，然后用更多的射线对结果进行细化。速度非常快但精度较低，特别是在小挤出和悬垂的情况下。不适用于薄表面。"

msgid "Cut Orientation"
msgstr "切割方向"

msgid "How the cut plane normal is aligned. Controls which axis the loop encircles"
msgstr "切割平面法线的对齐方式。控制环所环绕的轴。"

msgid "World"
msgstr "世界轴"

msgid "Align to the closest world axis"
msgstr "与最近的 world axis 对齐"

msgid "Align to the closest local axis of the source object"
msgstr "与源对象的最近局部轴对齐"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "法线"

msgid "Align to the face normal under the stroke"
msgstr "与笔触下方的面法线对齐"

msgid "View"
msgstr "视图"

msgid "Align to the stroke direction on screen"
msgstr "在屏幕上与笔触方向对齐"

msgid "Depth"
msgstr "深度"

msgid ""
"Number of surfaces to pass through when raycasting. \n"
"For example, a regular cylinder needs 1 while a solidified cylinder needs 2. \n"
"Increase when the loop gets stuck inside the source or decrease if it gets stuck to background surfaces."
msgstr ""
"射线投射时穿过的表面数量。\n"
"例如，普通圆柱体需要 1，而实体化圆柱体需要 2。\n"
"如果循环卡住源对象内部则增加此值，如果卡住背景表面则减少此值."

msgid "Refinement Steps"
msgstr "细化步骤"

msgid "Number of post processing iterations to refine the sampled cut along the surface."
msgstr "沿表面采样的切线进行细化迭代次数。"

msgid "Samples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "The number of rays to fire from the volume center to find the surface"
msgstr "从体积中心发射的射线数量，用于查找表面"

msgid "Sample Width"
msgstr "采样宽度"

msgid "The width of extra 2 sample points along the stroke that help triangulate the volume center. Both points should be over the surface you want to wrap around."
msgstr "沿路径额外添加的 2 个采样点，用于辅助三角化体积中心。这两个点都应位于您希望包裹的表面之上。"

msgid "Step Size"
msgstr "步长"

msgid "Multiplier for how far each step travels along the cross-section. Smaller values trace detailed surfaces more accurately but require more steps"
msgstr "沿截面每步移动的倍率。较小的值能更准确地追踪详细表面，但需要更多步骤。"

msgid "Grid Size"
msgstr "网格大小"

msgid "The initial size of the sampling grid, as a fraction of the stroke. Smaller is more accurate but slower to compute."
msgstr "采样网格的初始大小，占笔触的比例。越小越精确但计算速度越慢。"

msgid "Pixel Refine"
msgstr "像素细化"

msgid ""
"Adaptive 3x3 subdivision passes over cells near the boundary. \n"
"Raise to separate thin surfaces or objects that are close to but not quite touching."
msgstr ""
"边界附近的单元格自适应 3x3 细分。\n"
"将薄表面或物体分开，"

msgid "Number of adaptive subdivision passes and raycasts to refine the cut along the surface."
msgstr "使其接近但不接触。|||~|||自适应细分次数和射线投射数量，"

msgid "Grid Scale"
msgstr "用于细化沿表面的切割。|||~|||网格尺度|||~|||网格边界相对于测量体积的大小。"

msgid ""
"How large the boundary of the grid is compared to the measured volume. \n"
"Smaller is more accurate for the same performance but more likely to miss areas in complex objects"
msgstr ""
"网格边界相对于测量体积的大小。\n"
"对于相同的性能，越小越准确，但更有可能遗漏复杂物体中的区域。"

msgid "Curvature Bias"
msgstr "曲率偏差"

msgid "Blend between even spacing (0.0) and pure curvature/RDP placement (1.0). At 0.5, high-deviation points are placed by shape and low-deviation points spread evenly"
msgstr "在均匀间距（0.0）和纯曲率/RDP 放置（1.0）之间进行混合。在 0.5 时，高偏差点由形状确定，低偏差点均匀分布。"

msgid "Space Evenly"
msgstr "均匀分布"

msgid "0.0 = keep bridge snap result as-is, 1.0 = space verts evenly around the path"
msgstr "0.0 = 保持桥接吸附结果不变，1.0 = 沿路径均匀分布顶点"

